WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.167 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.068 line:92%
Republicans announced last night

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
that the latest
GOP health-care plan

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:05.438 line:92%
will not be moving forward,

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:09.509
making this the second draft of
the bill to fail in the Senate.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.444 size:75% position:38%
Though when it comes
to President Trump,

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.380 line:92%
the third time's the charm.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.749 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:19.052 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
It's the second draft

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.926
of the Republican health-care
bill to fail in the Senate.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.061 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"What's a second draft?"

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
asked the writer
of "Transformers."

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:33.400 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:35.435 size:81% position:41% line:92%
According to Politico,

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
the news that two additional
Republican senators

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
were not supporting
the GOP health-care plan

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:42.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
came as a surprise
to President Trump.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:45.445 size:88% position:44%
And if there's one thing
President Trump hates,

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:46.446 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
it's Eric.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.583 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:56.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
After the failure of
the GOP health-care plan,

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.324
Majority Leader Mitch McConnell
outlined plans

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:02.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
to repeal Obamacare
without a bill to replace it,

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.963 line:92%
the same way we got rid of Obama

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
without a good plan
to replace him.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.235 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:13.106 line:92%
Have it laid out in advance.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:17.243
Following news that the Senate
health-care plan will not pass,

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.279 size:75% position:38%
President Trump said
that it is important

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:22.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
to get more Republicans
into office.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:23.016 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
More?

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:25.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pretty sure when
the Titanic was sinking,

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.421 line:92%
the answer wasn't more icebergs.

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:29.923 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:32.492 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:33.993 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
According...

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to reports,
the eighth person

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:37.931 line:92%
who was present at the meeting

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
between Donald Trump Jr.
and a Russian lawyer

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:41.568 size:75% position:38% line:92%
has been identified,

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:44.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you're not going to
believe who it was.

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:47.373 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.477 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Double Gumps.

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:53.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to
a new Bloomberg poll,

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:54.514 line:92%
people view President Trump

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.783 align:start size:94% position:6%
more favorably
than Hillary Clinton.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:02:00.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
Said one voter,
"He just seems more fun."

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.921 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.557 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:09.562
According to reports, the actor
who voices Kermit the Frog

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.330 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
was fired by Disney

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
for his repeated unacceptable
business conduct.

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
Apparently --
and this is pretty shocking --

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:18.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
he put his hand
up a coworker's butt.

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:21.007 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.411 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Not Kermit's.

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:29.449
A woman in China was recently
stopped by customs officials

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:31.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
for trying to sneak
over 100 iPhones

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:35.655
from Hong Kong to mainland China
by strapping them to her body.

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
She would've
gotten away with it,

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
but then someone said,
"Hey, Siri,"

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.427 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a hundred voices
said, "Yes?"

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.929 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:45.498 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:51.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
A 97 -- A 97-year-old
Philadelphia man

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:54.073
who left high school early
to fight in World War II

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
received his diploma
this weekend.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:59.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
And his parents
didn't even show up!

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:02.215 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.622 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's better.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't want a couple
of 125-year-olds

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:16.029 line:92%
sitting through graduation.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:18.998 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Wheezes ]

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:23.303 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Is that him?!"

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:24.571 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:27.040 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:29.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
Today was
National Sour Candy Day.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:34.113
Either that, or that's just what
Mike Pence's face looks like.

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:37.250 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
the NYPD is searching

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:46.793 size:84% position:42%
for a person who stole
a 100-year-old tortoise

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:47.961 size:84% position:42% line:92%
from an animal shelter.

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:49.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
The ancient tortoise
was last seen

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:52.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
failing to pass
a new health-care bill.

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:54.534 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:57.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
"We tried very hard.
We tried very, very hard."

00:03:57.003 --> 00:04:00.773
Ladies and gentlemen, we got
a great show for you tonight!

